{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Space is cold. Endless. And indifferent.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Stellar Freight: Echoes of the Void</strong>, you take on the role of a long-haul freight ship captain, traveling through deep space. Every jump carries danger. Every choice has consequences. Every battle could be your last. This is a game about survival, responsibility, and constant resource scarcity \u2014 where every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your crew, upgrade your ship, trade, respond to events, engage in combat, complete missions, and try to survive in a hostile world for as long as possible. Your journey isn\u2019t about glory \u2014 it\u2019s about making it through another day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/3d2b16b387bf4f5fb8a78cf6e0a8056f.poster.avif?t=1768579133\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/3d2b16b387bf4f5fb8a78cf6e0a8056f.webm?t=1768579133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/3d2b16b387bf4f5fb8a78cf6e0a8056f.mp4?t=1768579133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival in deep space</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entire game revolves around one main goal \u2014 survival.<br>Fuel is limited. Credits are not infinite. Pirates and alien factions lurk at every turn. Sometimes you\u2019ll have to choose: refuel or save resources for repairs. Help someone or pass by. This is a game about decisions that will make you think twice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/e3799c34d8c57199f165f864c9769c56.poster.avif?t=1768579133\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/e3799c34d8c57199f165f864c9769c56.webm?t=1768579133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/e3799c34d8c57199f165f864c9769c56.mp4?t=1768579133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dynamic system of events and routes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each jump advances time.<br>New events, situations, quests and encounters appear.<br>Some events include choices that directly affect the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/458660785c1a8e4b2d245c6435a84c5a.poster.avif?t=1768579133\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/458660785c1a8e4b2d245c6435a84c5a.webm?t=1768579133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/458660785c1a8e4b2d245c6435a84c5a.mp4?t=1768579133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship development and modules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship is more than just visuals \u2014 it\u2019s a system of characteristics that can be upgraded.<br>Upgrades are limited depending on the hull type.<br>Basic hulls allow only simple upgrades, while advanced and expensive hulls unlock more depth. Each upgrade level becomes more costly, so managing your resources is crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/2016415ffad5de778458e8a5366efe9f.poster.avif?t=1768579133\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/2016415ffad5de778458e8a5366efe9f.webm?t=1768579133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/2016415ffad5de778458e8a5366efe9f.mp4?t=1768579133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>A crew with unique roles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team consists of three specialists:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Commander</strong> boosts combat performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Engineer</strong> handles ship repairs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Navigator</strong> plots routes to special stations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All crew members gain experience and levels over time.<br>Their level unlocks new dialogue options, affects events, and increases bonuses.<br>You can also hire new members, dismiss old ones, or interact with them through in-game dialogues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/993a21187a0129b047e955a26f297928.poster.avif?t=1768579133\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/993a21187a0129b047e955a26f297928.webm?t=1768579133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/993a21187a0129b047e955a26f297928.mp4?t=1768579133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reputation and factions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you do \u2014 from completing quests to making choices in events \u2014 affects your reputation.<br>It can unlock or block access to new missions, affect enemy levels, and influence what types of events or quests appear.<br>Reputation isn\u2019t just a number \u2014 it\u2019s a system that shapes how the world reacts to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This isn\u2019t a story about heroes.</i><br><br><br><br><br><i>It\u2019s a story about those who survive \u2014 day by day, jump by jump \u2014 on the edge of the void.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3787890?t=1768579133","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/b89992a22d623c7674e6f5938a569827a251d088/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768579133","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/48ec6a0b59e76430655db22fb3fdc02a3de10a1d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768579133","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/48ec6a0b59e76430655db22fb3fdc02a3de10a1d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768579133","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3924420,"description":""}],"d