sic hulls allow only simple upgrades, while advanced and expensive hulls unlock more depth. Each upgrade level becomes more costly, so managing your resources is crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/2016415ffad5de778458e8a5366efe9f.poster.avif?t=1768579133\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/2016415ffad5de778458e8a5366efe9f.webm?t=1768579133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/2016415ffad5de778458e8a5366efe9f.mp4?t=1768579133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>A crew with unique roles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your team consists of three specialists:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Commander</strong> boosts combat performance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Engineer</strong> handles ship repairs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Navigator</strong> plots routes to special stations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All crew members gain experience and levels over time.<br>Their level unlocks new dialogue options, affects events, and increases bonuses.<br>You can also hire new members, dismiss old ones, or interact with them through in-game dialogues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/extras/993a21187a0129b047e955a26f297928.poster.avif?t=1768579133\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st