133","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/9a532d4a22184586118bb9e76808c948727cac89/ss_9a532d4a22184586118bb9e76808c948727cac89.600x338.jpg?t=1768579133"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/694926b0fa5511616b02bb69701b5d3ef37e1bff/ss_694926b0fa5511616b02bb69701b5d3ef37e1bff.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768579133","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/694926b0fa5511616b02bb69701b5d3ef37e1bff/ss_694926b0fa5511616b02bb69701b5d3ef37e1bff.600x338.jpg?t=1768579133"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/b7504e0dd5a2bd73be93ed1425bed3e0b3ce255e/ss_b7504e0dd5a2bd73be93ed1425bed3e0b3ce255e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768579133","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/b7504e0dd5a2bd73be93ed1425bed3e0b3ce255e/ss_b7504e0dd5a2bd73be93ed1425bed3e0b3ce255e.600x338.jpg?t=1768579133"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/cd2be5a9f40c4ad6f2eb54bec0ad2ec9e1493d06/ss_cd2be5a9f40c4ad6f2eb54bec0ad2ec9e1493d06.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768579133","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/cd2be5a9f40c4ad6f2eb54bec0ad2ec9e1493d06/ss_cd2be5a9f40c4ad6f2eb54bec0ad2ec9e1493d06.600x338.jpg?t=1768579133"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/b87850802932f5433d721a5748051d314fb9a2de/ss_b87850802932f5433d721a5748051d314fb9a2de.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768579133","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/b87850802932f5433d721a5748051d314fb9a2de/ss_b87850802932f5433d721a5748051d314fb9a2de.600x338.jpg?t=1768579133"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/fe6ceaf358876e00225cd0590cb2af8d14695f8a/ss_fe6ceaf358876e00225cd0590cb2af8d14695f8a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768579133","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/fe6ceaf358876e00225cd0590cb2af8d14695f8a/ss_fe6ceaf358876e00225cd0590cb2af8d14695f8a.600x338.jpg?t=1768579133"},{"id":6,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/3b44f245483514cd674508ca4bcb3982b88d4434/ss_3b44f245483514cd674508ca4bcb3982b88d4434.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768579133","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/3b44f245483514cd674508ca4bcb3982b88d4434/ss_3b44f245483514cd674508ca4bcb3982b88d4434.600x338.jpg?t=1768579133"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/b1eff46499246b2d1d5e69b063e493a322a2d1b8/ss_b1eff46499246b2d1d5e69b063e493a322a2d1b8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768579133","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/b1eff46499246b2d1d5e69b063e493a322a2d1b8/ss_b1eff46499246b2d1d5e69b063e493a322a2d1b8.600x338.jpg?t=1768579133"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/a23b5ef8725f59022c793ac177caec3195a31430/ss_a23b5ef8725f59022c793ac177caec3195a31430.1920x1080.jpg?t=1768579133","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3787890/a23b5ef8725f59022c793ac177caec3195a31430/ss_a23b5ef8725f59022c793ac177caec3195a31430.600x338.jpg?t=1768579133"}],"short_description":"Take command of a freight ship traveling through deep space. Every jump brings danger, every decision matters. Manage your crew, upgrade your ship, trade, fight, and survive in a hostile galaxy where resources are scarce and every day could be your last.","steam_appid":3787890,"support_info":{"email":"satellite235official@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Ukrainian, Spanish - Latin America, Simplified Chinese, German","type":"game","